Preamble
The Swiss Federal Council,
based on Articles 3 paragraph 2, 4 paragraph 1, 5 and 7 paragraph 5 of the Federal Act of 25 June 1982 on International Trade Measures, in implementation of the Agreement of 15 April 1994 on Rules of Origin (Annex 1A.11 of the Agreement Establishing the World Trade Organisation), Article 11 of the International Convention of 3 November 1923 Relating to the Simplification of Customs Formalities and Article 2 of the International Convention of 18 May 1973 on the Simplification and Harmonisation of Customs Procedures,
